[
 {
  "index": 0,
  "text": "There's a folder on your computer.",
  "start": 0.94,
  "end": 2.98
 },
 {
  "index": 1,
  "text": "Maybe it's called Projects.",
  "start": 3.55,
  "end": 4.94
 },
 {
  "index": 2,
  "text": "Maybe it's called AI Ideas.",
  "start": 5.46,
  "end": 8.05
 },
 {
  "index": 3,
  "text": "Inside that folder?",
  "start": 8.05,
  "end": 9.84
 },
 {
  "index": 4,
  "text": "An automation you started on a weekend.",
  "start": 9.84,
  "end": 13.61
 },
 {
  "index": 5,
  "text": "A custom GPT you opened once.",
  "start": 14.58,
  "end": 16.23
 },
 {
  "index": 6,
  "text": "A Claude project with three brilliant conversations and no finish line.",
  "start": 17.38,
  "end": 22.21
 },
 {
  "index": 7,
  "text": "If you keep starting over with AI projects,",
  "start": 22.21,
  "end": 25.11
 },
 {
  "index": 8,
  "text": "you don't need another idea.",
  "start": 25.81,
  "end": 27.42
 },
 {
  "index": 9,
  "text": "You need to finish one.",
  "start": 27.42,
  "end": 28.73
 },
 {
  "index": 10,
  "text": "I'm going to show you the one question that got me to finish.",
  "start": 29.65,
  "end": 33.84
 },
 {
  "index": 11,
  "text": "But first, you need to see where I was.",
  "start": 34.55,
  "end": 37.17
 },
 {
  "index": 12,
  "text": "It's a weeknight.",
  "start": 37.17,
  "end": 38.31
 },
 {
  "index": 13,
  "text": "The workday is finally over.",
  "start": 38.31,
  "end": 40.23
 },
 {
  "index": 14,
  "text": "The house has quieted down.",
  "start": 41.1,
  "end": 42.31
 },
 {
  "index": 15,
  "text": "You open the laptop and think,",
  "start": 42.63,
  "end": 46.14
 },
 {
  "index": 16,
  "text": "\"Tonight. I'm finally working on my project.\"",
  "start": 46.75,
  "end": 50.71
 },
 {
  "index": 17,
  "text": "Then you can't remember where you left off.",
  "start": 50.71,
  "end": 54.78
 },
 {
  "index": 18,
  "text": "You search your files.",
  "start": 55.97,
  "end": 57.74
 },
 {
  "index": 19,
  "text": "A notification.",
  "start": 57.74,
  "end": 58.92
 },
 {
  "index": 20,
  "text": "A text.",
  "start": 59.38,
  "end": 59.72
 },
 {
  "index": 21,
  "text": "Something you forgot to do.",
  "start": 60.11,
  "end": 62.05
 },
 {
  "index": 22,
  "text": "You get up.",
  "start": 62.05,
  "end": 62.8
 },
 {
  "index": 23,
  "text": "You come back.",
  "start": 62.8,
  "end": 63.78
 },
 {
  "index": 24,
  "text": "An hour is gone.",
  "start": 64.43,
  "end": 65.23
 },
 {
  "index": 25,
  "text": "The project hasn't moved.",
  "start": 65.23,
  "end": 66.52
 },
 {
  "index": 26,
  "text": "And you tell yourself,",
  "start": 66.96,
  "end": 67.92
 },
 {
  "index": 27,
  "text": "\"I'll do it this weekend.\"",
  "start": 68.27,
  "end": 70.33
 },
 {
  "index": 28,
  "text": "I know.",
  "start": 70.33,
  "end": 70.87
 },
 {
  "index": 29,
  "text": "Because I did that too.",
  "start": 70.87,
  "end": 72.83
 },
 {
  "index": 30,
  "text": "Now picture your unfinished project.",
  "start": 73.7,
  "end": 75.76
 },
 {
  "index": 31,
  "text": "Not a random one.",
  "start": 75.76,
  "end": 76.7
 },
 {
  "index": 32,
  "text": "The one that showed up the second I said \"folder.\"",
  "start": 77.9,
  "end": 83.33
 },
 {
  "index": 33,
  "text": "You can see the screen.",
  "start": 84.25,
  "end": 85.42
 },
 {
  "index": 34,
  "text": "You remember why you were excited.",
  "start": 85.97,
  "end": 88.27
 },
 {
  "index": 35,
  "text": "Maybe you remember the exact day you stopped.",
  "start": 88.71,
  "end": 91.39
 },
 {
  "index": 36,
  "text": "Hold that picture.",
  "start": 91.39,
  "end": 92.42
 },
 {
  "index": 37,
  "text": "Because I want you to hear this.",
  "start": 92.98,
  "end": 94.95
 },
 {
  "index": 38,
  "text": "Unfinished doesn't mean you failed.",
  "start": 94.95,
  "end": 97.11
 },
 {
  "index": 39,
  "text": "It means something mattered enough for you to begin.",
  "start": 98.27,
  "end": 102.78
 },
 {
  "index": 40,
  "text": "We spend our days building everyone else's future.",
  "start": 102.78,
  "end": 107.12
 },
 {
  "index": 41,
  "text": "We lead teams.",
  "start": 107.74,
  "end": 108.89
 },
 {
  "index": 42,
  "text": "We solve problems.",
  "start": 108.89,
  "end": 110.4
 },
 {
  "index": 43,
  "text": "We carry systems.",
  "start": 110.4,
  "end": 111.81
 },
 {
  "index": 44,
  "text": "And our own ideas get pushed into a folder.",
  "start": 112.33,
  "end": 114.84
 },
 {
  "index": 45,
  "text": "So here's the question that changed everything for me.",
  "start": 114.84,
  "end": 118.01
 },
 {
  "index": 46,
  "text": "I stopped asking,",
  "start": 119.31,
  "end": 120.28
 },
 {
  "index": 47,
  "text": "\"When will I have enough time?\"",
  "start": 120.28,
  "end": 121.97
 },
 {
  "index": 48,
  "text": "And started asking,",
  "start": 123.2,
  "end": 124.34
 },
 {
  "index": 49,
  "text": "\"Who do I need to become to keep the promise I made to myself?\"",
  "start": 125.05,
  "end": 131.26
 },
 {
  "index": 50,
  "text": "That question is where my 100-day lock-in began.",
  "start": 131.97,
  "end": 134.29
 },
 {
  "index": 51,
  "text": "I wasn't a developer.",
  "start": 135.56,
  "end": 136.76
 },
 {
  "index": 52,
  "text": "I was a teacher and a leader, still learning.",
  "start": 136.76,
  "end": 139.33
 },
 {
  "index": 53,
  "text": "And I entered a hackathon anyway.",
  "start": 140.61,
  "end": 144.84
 },
 {
  "index": 54,
  "text": "I built Serenity Reboot around three words:",
  "start": 145.45,
  "end": 148.79
 },
 {
  "index": 55,
  "text": "\"I need a reset.\"",
  "start": 149.33,
  "end": 150.16
 },
 {
  "index": 56,
  "text": "The system looks at your next seventy-two hours,",
  "start": 150.16,
  "end": 152.89
 },
 {
  "index": 57,
  "text": "sorts what matters,",
  "start": 153.67,
  "end": 154.61
 },
 {
  "index": 58,
  "text": "moves what can move,",
  "start": 154.61,
  "end": 155.6
 },
 {
  "index": 59,
  "text": "and walks you back toward calm.",
  "start": 155.6,
  "end": 157.17
 },
 {
  "index": 60,
  "text": "First place.",
  "start": 157.99,
  "end": 158.8
 },
 {
  "index": 61,
  "text": "Then I built Grow and Preserve OS in public.",
  "start": 158.8,
  "end": 161.98
 },
 {
  "index": 62,
  "text": "Fifteen days.",
  "start": 162.61,
  "end": 163.32
 },
 {
  "index": 63,
  "text": "Six AI agents.",
  "start": 163.32,
  "end": 164.09
 },
 {
  "index": 64,
  "text": "One of them scheduled a garlic harvest I never planted.",
  "start": 164.58,
  "end": 167.49
 },
 {
  "index": 65,
  "text": "That's another story.",
  "start": 168.44,
  "end": 169.62
 },
 {
  "index": 66,
  "text": "Then my team placed third in a group hackathon called AI Swarm.",
  "start": 169.62,
  "end": 173.27
 },
 {
  "index": 67,
  "text": "Here's what all three taught me.",
  "start": 173.91,
  "end": 175.63
 },
 {
  "index": 68,
  "text": "The breakthrough wasn't becoming a technical expert.",
  "start": 175.99,
  "end": 179.47
 },
 {
  "index": 69,
  "text": "The breakthrough was learning to turn an idea into small, finishable decisions.",
  "start": 180.41,
  "end": 185.13
 },
 {
  "index": 70,
  "text": "Maybe you're thinking,",
  "start": 185.13,
  "end": 186.42
 },
 {
  "index": 71,
  "text": "\"That's great. But you already knew what you were doing.\"",
  "start": 186.73,
  "end": 191.13
 },
 {
  "index": 72,
  "text": "I used to think that about other people too.",
  "start": 191.13,
  "end": 194.7
 },
 {
  "index": 73,
  "text": "But here's what I found.",
  "start": 195.14,
  "end": 196.59
 },
 {
  "index": 74,
  "text": "We don't need more confidence before we begin.",
  "start": 196.59,
  "end": 199.43
 },
 {
  "index": 75,
  "text": "Confidence gets built by beginning.",
  "start": 199.92,
  "end": 202.24
 },
 {
  "index": 76,
  "text": "We don't need another course.",
  "start": 202.24,
  "end": 204.14
 },
 {
  "index": 77,
  "text": "We need a reason to practice being the person who finishes.",
  "start": 204.72,
  "end": 208.57
 },
 {
  "index": 78,
  "text": "That's why I'm locking in for 100 days.",
  "start": 208.57,
  "end": 211.09
 },
 {
  "index": 79,
  "text": "And thirty of those days are a hackathon.",
  "start": 211.77,
  "end": 215.39
 },
 {
  "index": 80,
  "text": "My mentor Mark is running a 30-day AI hackathon inside the Early AI-Dopters community.",
  "start": 216.01,
  "end": 223.03
 },
 {
  "index": 81,
  "text": "One project.",
  "start": 223.03,
  "end": 223.96
 },
 {
  "index": 82,
  "text": "Thirty days.",
  "start": 224.32,
  "end": 224.96
 },
 {
  "index": 83,
  "text": "One step a day.",
  "start": 225.57,
  "end": 226.55
 },
 {
  "index": 84,
  "text": "A community building beside you.",
  "start": 226.55,
  "end": 228.7
 },
 {
  "index": 85,
  "text": "The link is below.",
  "start": 230.12,
  "end": 231.13
 },
 {
  "index": 86,
  "text": "It's my affiliate link, so I earn a portion of your membership if you join. I want you to know that.",
  "start": 231.13,
  "end": 236.86
 },
 {
  "index": 87,
  "text": "Now go back to your project.",
  "start": 238.41,
  "end": 239.98
 },
 {
  "index": 88,
  "text": "Imagine Day 30.",
  "start": 240.48,
  "end": 241.32
 },
 {
  "index": 89,
  "text": "You open your laptop,",
  "start": 242.5,
  "end": 244.05
 },
 {
  "index": 90,
  "text": "and this time you're not staring at an unfinished idea.",
  "start": 244.05,
  "end": 248.24
 },
 {
  "index": 91,
  "text": "You're looking at something you built.",
  "start": 248.59,
  "end": 251.77
 },
 {
  "index": 92,
  "text": "Maybe small.",
  "start": 251.77,
  "end": 252.71
 },
 {
  "index": 93,
  "text": "Maybe not perfect.",
  "start": 253.31,
  "end": 254.33
 },
 {
  "index": 94,
  "text": "But real.",
  "start": 254.33,
  "end": 254.8
 },
 {
  "index": 95,
  "text": "Someone else has used it.",
  "start": 254.8,
  "end": 256.24
 },
 {
  "index": 96,
  "text": "And when someone asks, \"What are you working on?\"",
  "start": 256.7,
  "end": 260.27
 },
 {
  "index": 97,
  "text": "you don't say, \"I'm learning AI.\"",
  "start": 260.27,
  "end": 262.57
 },
 {
  "index": 98,
  "text": "You say, \"I built this.\"",
  "start": 263.08,
  "end": 264.82
 },
 {
  "index": 99,
  "text": "Feel the difference.",
  "start": 264.82,
  "end": 266.46
 },
 {
  "index": 100,
  "text": "One is an activity.",
  "start": 267.31,
  "end": 268.83
 },
 {
  "index": 101,
  "text": "The other is an identity.",
  "start": 268.83,
  "end": 270.85
 },
 {
  "index": 102,
  "text": "So finish this sentence with me:",
  "start": 272.88,
  "end": 274.47
 },
 {
  "index": 103,
  "text": "\"By Day 30, I will have built ______.\"",
  "start": 274.47,
  "end": 275.9
 },
 {
  "index": 104,
  "text": "Don't make it impressive.",
  "start": 275.9,
  "end": 277.13
 },
 {
  "index": 105,
  "text": "Make it finishable.",
  "start": 278.29,
  "end": 279.3
 },
 {
  "index": 106,
  "text": "Too big? Cut it in half.",
  "start": 279.96,
  "end": 281.88
 },
 {
  "index": 107,
  "text": "Still too big? Cut it again.",
  "start": 282.93,
  "end": 284.85
 },
 {
  "index": 108,
  "text": "Put your sentence in the comments.",
  "start": 284.85,
  "end": 287.29
 },
 {
  "index": 109,
  "text": "That's your first public promise.",
  "start": 287.86,
  "end": 290.24
 },
 {
  "index": 110,
  "text": "And I'll be watching.",
  "start": 290.24,
  "end": 291.73
 },
 {
  "index": 111,
  "text": "I'll see you tomorrow.",
  "start": 292.31,
  "end": 293.38
 },
 {
  "index": 112,
  "text": "Protect your peace. Vibrate your power. And build what the future needs from you.",
  "start": 293.75,
  "end": 300.34
 }
]